DESCRIPTION:Mickey Mouse Day falls on November 18\, the date Disney itself 
 treats as Mickey's birthday. It marks the 1928 opening of Steamboat Willie
  at the Colony Theater in New York\, the short that put the character in f
 ront of a paying audience with synchronized sound after two earlier Mickey
  cartoons had failed to find a distributor. The date is younger than the m
 ouse: for four decades the studio moved the birthday around the calendar b
 efore an archivist settled it.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/mick
 ey-mouse-day/
